# WordPress AI Client

Ahentic uses WordPress’s official AI libraries wherever possible, so we stay aligned with the **AI Building Blocks for WordPress** direction.

## Primary LLM driver

- Use **[WordPress/php-ai-client](https://github.com/WordPress/php-ai-client)** (`wordpress/php-ai-client`) as the main provider-agnostic PHP SDK for talking to generative AI models.
- Prefer its uniform API (`WordPress\AiClient\AiClient`, prompt/embedding builders, providers) over custom HTTP clients or vendor-specific SDKs.
- Do not introduce alternate PHP AI client libraries unless there is a clear gap that php-ai-client cannot cover — and document why.

## Installation

```bash
composer require wordpress/php-ai-client
```

Bundle via Composer in the plugin (it is an SDK, not a WordPress plugin).

## Usage direction

- Server-side generation, embeddings, and provider selection go through php-ai-client.
- Keep provider details behind this SDK so OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, etc. remain swappable.
- When WordPress adds related AI building blocks (abilities, MCP, etc.), prefer those official packages over one-off implementations.
